"2042","Sahl ibn al-Ḥanẓaliyyah narrated that they traveled with the Messenger of Allah (peace be upon him) on the day of Ḥunayn. They traveled extensively until it was evening. The time for prayer arrived while they were with the Messenger of Allah (peace be upon him). A horseman came and said: ""O Messenger of Allah! I went ahead of you until I climbed such-and-such mountain, and there I saw Hawāzin on their mounts with their women, children, and sheep gathered at Ḥunayn."" The Messenger of Allah (peace be upon him) smiled and said: ""That is the spoils of the Muslims tomorrow, if Allah wills."" Then he said: ""Who will guard us tonight?"" Anas ibn Abī Marthad al-Ghanawī said: ""I will, O Messenger of Allah."" He said: ""Then ride."" So he rode his horse and came to the Messenger of Allah (peace be upon him). The Messenger of Allah (peace be upon him) said: ""Face this mountain pass until you are at its top, and do not let us be taken by surprise from your direction tonight."" When morning came, the Messenger of Allah (peace be upon him) went out to his place of prayer and prayed two rakʿahs. Then he said: ""Did you perceive your horseman?"" They said: ""O Messenger of Allah! We did not perceive him."" The call to prayer (iqāmah) was made, and the Messenger of Allah (peace be upon him) prayed while turning towards the mountain pass until he finished his prayer and gave the salām. He said: ""Rejoice, for your horseman has come to you."" We looked through the trees in the mountain pass, and there he was, coming until he stood before the Messenger of Allah (peace be upon him) and gave salām. He said: ""I went until I was at the top of this mountain pass where the Messenger of Allah (peace be upon him) commanded me. When morning came, I overlooked both mountain passes and saw no one."" The Messenger of Allah (peace be upon him) said to him: ""Did you dismount tonight?"" He said: ""No, except to pray or relieve myself."" The Messenger of Allah (peace be upon him) said to him: ""You have earned (Paradise), so there is no blame on you if you do not work after it."""
